    {
      "id": "fn-737",
      "kind": "feature",
      "mode": "update",
      "one_line": "One page names each kind of part, sets out eleven principles, each with its reason and the ADR it comes from, and says how the standard is kept."
    },
    {
      "id": "fn-738",
      "kind": "feature",
      "mode": "update",
      "one_line": "Every change to the standard or its rule files is an accepted ADR that names each older ADR it supersedes or amends, and each older ADR points forward to it."
    },
